Yay! Second ascension!

Two weeks ago I made my first ascension (with Archeologist). Now I
made it with Valkyrie.

This was a pretty boring game. Never got crowned, no bones, no wishes
(except /oW in the castle), no magic markers, no =oC, nothing!

First I solved sokoban (BoH) then went to Gnomish Mines. A co-aligned
temple in minetown (the only temple before Gehennom). Sacrifest! The
blessed rustproof +2 Mjollnir. After mines I had AC -9, XP lvl11;
dagger and long sword skills on expert, hammer on basic (no enough
skill slots to advance it) and I was sure she will ascend.

Nothing worth of mention before Medusa. On Medusa island I fell
through a trap door. When I was looking for way up stepped on
polymorph trap and polymorphed into ogre and broke my +1 elven mithril
coat. Hp: 19. Not good. I tried to pray but my god didn´t understand
my problem. Then I met hostile ettin mummy. I had to tame it with
b?oT. When I turned back to human, I had to wear plate mail that I
found, and got burdened. After while I met minotaur. After few hits I
had only 5 hps left. And I had prayed just a while ago. And I couldn´t
run. And I had no /oT or /oD. (Do minotaurs respect Elbereth?)

No means of escape. She was doomed. I knew that she will die. So I
kneeled and prayed one last time.

...

Tyr had mercy on me and restored all my hps (Why? I´m quite sure that
prayer timeout wasn´t zero). That was close! Then I killed that
Minotaur. I went up and killed Medusa (with mirror). I got boots of
levitation. I went back to lvl6 to get another elven mithril coat.
Then I went to the castle. 2 silver dragons, black dragon, no scales.
Only red one dropped scales, but I didn´t want them.

I wished for 3 blessed scrolls of charging, blessed +3 grey dragon
scale mail, blessed rustproof +3 gauntlets of power (got +0), blessed
+3 cloak of displacement (got +0, didn´t remember to wish fireproof
cloak, didn´t wear it before elementary planes), blessed +3 shield of
reflection and blessed magic marker (the only magic marker in whole
game). Then I went to quest. Piece of cake. After quest I found Fort
Ludios (first time ever). Another piece of cake. I bought some
protection in minetown.

Gehennom. I killed Asmodeus and Baalzebub, Juiblex escaped. Vlad.
Finally an amulet of life saving (I saw only two of these in whole
game, gnome king in mines had another). In Orcus´s town I got slimed
but /oF saved the day. I killed Orcus and Yeenoghu. Vibrating square,
Rodney, invocation. Moloch's Sanctum. In middle point, my hp dropped
below 70. I didn´t want to use potion of full healing so run away and
locked a door, and waited. Then again.

Killed high priest, got amulet. Mysterious force wasn´t nearly as bad
as last time. This time I got teleported few times, first time few
dozen times.

Last time I had troubles in plane of earth, because I didn´t have many
charges left in my wands of digging. This time I took atleast 10 /oD
with me. I used 2 of them. Air was real thriller. It was quite hard to
walk. Then I remembered I had to use levitation. I opened bag of
holding. No boots of levitation! Did I drop them before I ascended to
planes? I had to make it in hard way. To top of it off there was a
black dragon and I didn´t have disintegration resistance. I had hard
time finding a portal on plane of fire, because I didn´t have any kind
of light source. Same thing on plane of water.

Astral plane. I got a guardian angel. Death, Famine and Pestilence.
First I quaffed 3 b!oGL and went to middle. Wrong altar. Then right.
Lawful.

I should have tried genoless conduct. :)

What next? Maybe a wizard or a healer? A priest or a barbarian
shouldn´t be too hard either. Or maybe ranger or rogue?
Recommendation?

